+
+## Registration query API
+
+Use the versioned read-only registration query when a consumer must retain every agent, harness type, and project tuple:
+
+```bash
+scripts/api.sh get teams <team> registrations --schema-version 1
+```
+
+A successful response is one JSON object with `schemaVersion: 1`, `resource: "registrations"`, `complete: true`, and every registration in `registrations`. Duplicate tuples remain visible. A nonzero result has `complete: false` and `registrations: null`; consumers must not treat it as an empty result. The query reads one requested team only, validates a snapshot before emitting success, and reports a concurrent source replacement instead of combining states. It performs no registry, database, runtime, or process mutation.
